{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-day-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.63, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-day`: THC, CO and NOx at running exhaust, start exhaust, crankcase start, extended idle and APU for the passenger car, the light commercial truck and the combination long-haul truck at Washtenaw County SINGLE scale, January and July 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, with `<aggregateBy key=\"24-Hour Day\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Month\"/>`, from the default database plus a county database stating startsPerDay and four hotelling tables (`inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`, built from moves.rs `setup-timeagg.sql`). MOVESOutput is 12,576 rows, 6,288 per month.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the ORDER of MOVES's operations: InputDataManager.preAggregateExecutionDB runs PreAggDAY.sql BEFORE any generator, so TotalActivityGenerator's AdjustStarts.sql and AdjustHotelling.sql read collapsed tables -- startsHourFraction summed per day, startsOpModeDistribution weighted by it, sourceTypeHour's hotellingDist summed, hotellingHourFraction summed -- and the rate side reads ZoneMonthHour collapsed with ONE source type's HourWeighting3, averaged over the day types. Measured in pandas against the execution database before the port: startsHourFraction 6 of 6 at 2.2e-16, startsOpModeDistribution 1968 of 1968 at 3.8e-16, sourceTypeHour 2 of 2 at 2.2e-16, AvgSpeedDistribution 384 of 384 at 4.5e-06 (the column's storage), ZoneMonthHour at 6.8e-10 -- 5.0e-04 summing HourWeighting2 over the source types instead (PLAN.md §7.3.63).\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 6288, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs per (county, month, day) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "off-network-idle",
      "hotelling-adjustment",
      "time-aggregation",
      "starts",
      "output-time-step"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-day/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-day/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows, monthIDs 1 and 7 (`<month key=\"0\"/>` and `\"6\"` are 0-based).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-day/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 0 -- the SYNTHESIZED `Entire Day` PreAggDAY.sql writes into HourOfAnyDay, not an hour of the clock. The RunSpec selects all 24 hours.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../movesdb/HourOfAnyDay.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "THE 24 HOURS EACH DAY TYPE IS COLLAPSED OVER: the default database's own `HourOfAnyDay`. `<aggregateBy key=\"24-Hour Day\"/>` collapses every hour of the day before any generator runs (PreAggDAY.sql).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/scale-county-timeagg-day/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows, hourDayIDs 2 and 5: PreAggDAY.sql's collapsed HourDay, `hourDayID = dayID` at hourID 0, which the default `hourday` does not hold. `rsd_dayID` and `rsd_hourID` unpack it as the SQL does (`mod(hourDayID,10)`, `floor(hourDayID/10)`), so each cell is its day type at the synthesized hour.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
